# Vendored third-party libraries.
#
# CMB2 is an unmodified upstream copy bundled under thp-core/lib/CMB2/ (see
# thp-core/lib/CMB2/VENDORED.md). Mark it so GitHub Linguist excludes it from
# language stats and collapses it in diffs / PR reviews.
#
# NOTE ON THE PATH: this repo nests the plugin package one level down, so the
# committed path is thp-core/lib/CMB2/ (verify with `git ls-files thp-core/lib/CMB2/`).
# These patterns contain a slash and are therefore anchored to this file's
# location (the repo root), so they must carry the thp-core/ prefix -- a bare
# `lib/CMB2/**` would match nothing. Do not "simplify" it.
thp-core/lib/CMB2/** linguist-vendored
thp-core/lib/CMB2/** linguist-generated
